stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Startscreen : power-up / reset
    Startscreen --> GameInit : button
    GameInit --> GameUpdate : button
    GameUpdate --> GameUpdate : frame tick (move ball + paddles)
    GameUpdate --> GameReset : miss_left / miss_right
    GameReset --> GameInit : game not over
    GameReset --> FinalScreen : 3 points or 6 balls
    FinalScreen --> Startscreen : button / reset

    Startscreen : Startscreen
    Startscreen : welcome message
    GameInit : Game - init
    GameInit : ball in centre, paddles reset
    GameUpdate : Game - update
    GameUpdate : once per frame (60 Hz)
    GameReset : Game - reset
    GameReset : score_l or score_r +1, check end rule
    FinalScreen : Final screen
    FinalScreen : show winning colour
